mmary\":{\"total_count\":1,\"summary_text\":\"Most customers left positive feedback, praising the game's good graphics and impressive sound quality. While some players found the experience boring with nothing to look forward to, others reported excessive damage that hit them and dealt an insane amount of damage every time.\"},\"featured_reviews\":[{\"comment_id\":332512383,\"user_name\":\"Juggaloco305\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is a very underrated indie game where you play the role police officers. You actually feel like a cop, arresting people and answering phone calls and crime scene scenes definitely worth a try by a physical. If you can they probably won’t be much more copies.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"create_time\":1791589506},{\"comment_id\":330704400,\"user_name\":\"Chitown312\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"I've played at the easist level for about an hour. It's been fun, but very basic.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1790957858},{\"comment_id\":259904792,\"user_name\":\"LOGAND\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I was starting to lose hope on the release. Was so much fun when i finally got my hands on it. Really hope they make another follow up to this!!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1786296119},{\"comment_id\":259904790,\"user_name\":\"JOSEV\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Good price 5 start quality very easy to play price was very accessible compared with other local stores\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1785822380},{\"comment_id\":259904791,\"user_name\":\"Kriziz2k3\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"Really good game, is not gta but is fun in other ways\",\"medias\":[{\"media_type\":1,\"image_id\":\"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86YmVzdGJ1eQ/cda55e69-1426-595d-a169-003791c2bb92\"}],\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1785532166}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Release date\",\"value\":\"June 20, 2025\"},{\"name\":\"Product Dimensions\",\"value\":\"0.44 x 6.63 x 5.25 inches; 3.04 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Type of item\",\"value\":\"Video Game\"},{\"name\":\"Language\",\"value\":\"English\"},{\"name\":\"Rated\",\"value\":\"Teen\"},{\"name\":\"Item Weight\",\"value\":\"3.04 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Manufacturer\",\"value\":\"Microids\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nOfficer Nick Cordell Jr. rookie cop in Averno City, 1983.\\nNeon-noir action sandbox police game with destructible environments.\\nThrilling vehicle chases and shootouts in a living city.\\nSolve mystery of your father's murder and protect citizens.\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nDive into a world of thrilling car chases, sandbox crimes, and 1980s noir as you protect the populace and uncover the truth behind your father's murder. The game combines police simulation with action sandbox spectacle, allowing you to patrol the streets and respond to callouts ranging from parking infractions to bank heists.\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nSpeed through the city in intense car and helicopter chases, pursuing marks through twisting alleyways before bringing them to justice. You have an in-depth support system that allows you to call in squad cars, roadblocks, spike strips, and more assistance.\\nUsage/Scenarios\\nExplore the ever-shifting criminal underbelly of Averno City, dealing with yuppies, bums, street vendors, and furious taxi drivers from the projects to the financial district. Chase perps through neon-lit alleys, rain-soaked streets, and grand, decaying parklands. Experience the 1980s east coast in all its neon-noir glory, featuring a day/night cycle and dynamic weather conditions.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"amazon-B0F9LW9Y27-B0F8G7CXBC\",\"product_id\":120000568900074,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012664485\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Precinct-PlayStation-5/dp/B0F8G7CXBC?th=1\\u0026psc=1\\u0026language=en_US\\u0026currency=USD\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":3992000,\"range