ood better than any other I've tried, and believe me I've tried them all. I would recommend this can food for any dog, especially picky eaters.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"comment_id\":302911948,\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is a great low cost highly rated canned grain-free dog food. I highly recommend it for your dog! I have been using this brand for a couple years and have served my dogs all the varieties available and they love it. I am so excited that Chewy is carrying it!! The petstores our by me stopped carrying the product or were always out of it so I found a company that I purchased it from, sadly the delivery took so long you had to plan on ordering but now with Chewy, no problems they have fast shipping.. I have a rescue and now I can promote Dave's and Chewy to everyone!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"comment_id\":302911947,\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"I was disappointed when I opened the first can and discovered that Dave's 95% Premium Meats is a pate type of dog food (it looks similar to potted meat not ground meat). However, I was both surprised and very happy that my dog actually liked it! Dave's is the first pate style food that my GSD ever liked. I love that it is grain free, chicken free and high protein. Also, Chewy has great prices and very fast free delivery with a minimum order.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"comment_id\":302911946,\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I tried Dave's Beef Canned food for the first time. I tried it, because one of her usual canned items wasn't available. Wow, she has never wolfed down any food so quickly and continues to be enthusiastic. It is a little expensive, but Cassie has allergies, so better to pay more for quality food, than for vet bills The cans were perfect. Didn't have dented cans, like another reviewer.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Brand Name\",\"value\":\"Dave's Pet Food\"},{\"name\":\