 45 inches; 12.5 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Item model number\",\"value\":\"6-85038-11802-8\"},{\"name\":\"Date First Available\",\"value\":\"March 14, 2019\"},{\"name\":\"Manufacturer\",\"value\":\"Dave's Pet Food, Inc.\"},{\"name\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B07PSZHRCX\"},{\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"170\"},{\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Dave's Pet Food\"},{\"name\":\"Flavor\",\"value\":\"95% Beef \\u0026 Beef Liver\"},{\"name\":\"Age Range (Description)\",\"value\":\"Adult\"},{\"name\":\"Item Form\",\"value\":\"Pate\"},{\"name\":\"Specific Uses For Product\",\"value\":\"Appetite Stimulation, Diabetic Support, Muscle Care, Sensitive Stomach, Weight Management\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\n95% single-source beef and beef liver protein\\nGrain-free formula with no wheat, gluten, or starches\\nMade in USA with added vitamins and minerals\\nComplete and balanced meal for dogs with allergies\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nThis 12.5 oz can contains a nutrient-dense recipe designed for dogs with allergies, offering a complete and balanced meal or a topper. The formula has virtually no carbs to prevent blood sugar spikes in diabetic dogs and serves as an inexpensive alternative to a raw diet.\\nMaterials \\u0026 Craftsmanship\\nThe product is made in the USA and features limited ingredients added vitamins and minerals. It contains no wheat, gluten, starches, rice, cereal, artificial flavors, or coloring.\\nDimensions/Packaging\\nThe package includes 12 cans, each weighing 12.5 oz.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"chewy-157467-184210\",\"product_id\":120000533923369,\"cspu_id\":\"100000004403480\",\"url\":\"https://www.chewy.com/daves-pet-food-95-premium-beef-beef/dp/184210\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":4999000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"chewy\",\"supplier_rating\":4.4071,\"website\":\"chewy\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824g6-mput5xkspnnk49\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/0803c9e8c53a44c197b00a5f01814d03\"],\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"I was disappointed when I opened the first can and discovered that Dave's 95% Premium Meats is a pate type of dog food (it looks similar to potted meat not ground meat). However, I was both surprised and very happy that my dog actually liked it! Dave's is the first pate style food that my GSD ever liked. I love that it is grain free, chicken free and high protein. Also, Chewy has great prices and very fast free delivery with a minimum order.\"},{\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"We were feeding our diabetic (13 units twice a day) dog a vet recommended prescription dog food for months, which was expensive, but Emily seemed to continue to get worse. She was lethargic, and didn't have much energy. All kinds of physical issues crept up on her. She got to the point where she had trouble walking and we were thinking the worse. Vet's couldn't tell us what was wrong, so we decided to try a change of diet and came across Dave's. We stopped the vet food and after 3 weeks she's like a new dog. Energetic, no whimpering, tail wagging, running around. Glucose levels are great and she loves the taste. Had to beg her to eat before but not any more. Not saying this is miracle food, but it was for us, and we're enjoying every minute of it.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"My two German Shepherds, Zach and Ziva, love Dave's grain free 95% beef canned food and I love that it is very healthy and doesn't break the bank! You will never say, \\\"Where's the beef?\\\" with this food! It is the perfect consistency to mix with dry food as a topper. It causes no stomach upset either. I do wish that Dave's would remove carrageenan from all its canned foods. This one does not have it.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This is a great low cost highly rated canned grain-free dog food. I highly recommend